From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jrash <johnrash@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 02:15:43 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 049/342] build: HaikuDepot, SoftwareUpdater and Repositories
 on arm64 again

They were left out of arm64 regular images because arm64 has no
package repositories with more than bootstrap packages. A port that
serves its own repository (the ODROID-C2 one does) needs them.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 build/jam/images/definitions/regular | 6 +++---
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/build/jam/images/definitions/regular b/build/jam/images/definitions/regular
index 4c46a86ee3..0398c92c98 100644
--- a/build/jam/images/definitions/regular
+++ b/build/jam/images/definitions/regular
@@ -35,7 +35,7 @@ SYSTEM_APPS += [ FFilterByBuildFeatures
 	AutoRaise
 	CodyCam
 	GLInfo@mesa
-	HaikuDepot@!arm64
+	HaikuDepot
 	Icon-O-Matic@expat
 	LaunchBox
 	LegacyPackageInstaller
@@ -50,7 +50,7 @@ SYSTEM_APPS += [ FFilterByBuildFeatures
 	RemoteDesktop
 	Screenshot
 	SerialConnect
-	SoftwareUpdater@!arm64
+	SoftwareUpdater
 	SoundRecorder
 ] ;
 
@@ -83,7 +83,7 @@ SYSTEM_PREFERENCES += [ FFilterByBuildFeatures
 	E-mail
 	Media@fluidlite
 	Printers
-	Repositories@!arm64
+	Repositories
 	ScreenSaver
 	Sounds
 ] ;
